hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15592","Yahya ibn Adam narrated to us: Abu al-Ahwas narrated to us, from Shabib ibn Gharqadah al-Bariqi, from Sulayman ibn Amr ibn al-Ahwas, from his father, he said: I witnessed the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) addressing the people in the Farewell Hajj and saying: Which day is your day? Then he mentioned his address on the day of Sacrifice."
